From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Subject: [PATCH] common/pe_switch.h: Common::PeSwitch (exact "1" enables an experimental switch)

Upstream (Vampinity ocarina-test-2) adds this header in 0310-pe-gc-evictions, which is not ported here;
0342, 0408, 0411, 0429-0431 include it. Header only, unchanged.
---
diff --git a/src/common/pe_switch.h b/src/common/pe_switch.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b3a6612
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/common/pe_switch.h
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
+#pragma once
+#include <cstdlib>
+
+namespace Common {
+// Callers cache this at first use; only an exact "1" enables an experimental PE port.
+inline bool PeSwitch(const char* name) noexcept {
+    const char* value = std::getenv(name);
+    return value != nullptr && value[0] == '1' && value[1] == '\0';
+}
+} // namespace Common
